sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Applicant (funder or NGO)
  participant W as Web (Join)
  participant F as Firebase Auth
  participant API as ProofPocket API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL (RLS)
  actor Ad as Admin
  participant M as Gmail SMTP
  A->>W: Sign up (email + password, or Google)
  W->>F: createUser + sendEmailVerification
  A->>F: Open the verification link
  A->>W: Join → Investor / Funder (or Incubator / NGO), two steps
  W->>API: POST /join/applications {kind, details}
  API->>API: Zod (shared rules): SA ID check digit, phones, sizes
  API->>DB: insert portal_applications (status pending, ID number AES-256-GCM)<br/>as role joining, own firebase_uid only
  API->>DB: audit portal_application.sent
  Note over A,W: Returning: "We're checking your application" (GET /join/application)
  Ad->>W: User approvals (pending first)
  W->>API: GET /admin/approvals, GET /admin/approvals/application/:id
  alt Approve
    Ad->>API: POST /admin/approvals/application/:id {decision: approve}
    API->>DB: organisations (verified) + users (funder or adviser) + application approved
    API->>M: "Your ProofPocket application was approved"
  else Reject (reason required)
    Ad->>API: POST /admin/approvals/application/:id {decision: reject, reason}
    API->>DB: application rejected + reason
    API->>M: "Your ProofPocket application" with the reason
  end
  API->>DB: audit portal_application.approved / rejected
  Note over DB: founder_admin_log(): founders see date, action, role, organisation only
